  "summary": "实现访问新网址、后退若干步和前进若干步的浏览器历史。访问新网址会丢弃当前页之后的前进历史。",
  "insight": "用列表保存线性历史和 current 下标；visit 时截断 current 之后元素，back/forward 只钳制下标。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "访问新页必须清空前进记录",
    "后退和前进可能超过可用步数",
    "返回移动后的当前网址"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "history-list-cursor",
      "title": "历史列表与游标",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "以数组下标表示当前页面并在新访问时截断尾部。",
      "steps": [
        "构造 history=[homepage],current=0",
        "visit 删除 current 后所有元素，再添加 url 并 current++",
        "back=max(0,current-steps)，forward=min(last,current+steps)，返回 history[current]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n) visit, O(1) navigation",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/history-list-cursor/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/history-list-cursor/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/history-list-cursor/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
